[00:18.84]1. Precious to God, we are daughters and sons,
[00:27.68]Giving our strength as his faithful young ones.
[00:34.62]Loving attention to us he will give,
[00:41.12]Blessing our days for as long as we live.
[01:21.62]2. Honoring parents who care for our lives
[01:28.54]Helps us express what we’re feeling inside.
[01:35.86]Then we find favor with God and with men,
[01:42.16]Drawing us close to Jehovah, our Friend.
[02:15.68]3. May we remember our God in our youth,
[02:20.86]Growing each day in our love of the truth.
[02:27.62]Giving our best to our God, we will bring
[02:33.60]Joy to the heart of Jehovah, our King.
